 - **`desktop/windows/browser/junit-and-tap-verification-exporter.cjs`**:
   - `buildJUnitXmlAndTap14ResearchReport(report)` and `saveJUnitAndTapVerificationReportViaWorkspace`: exports multi-site research verification results into CI-ready JUnit XML (`reports/<slug>-junit.xml`) and TAP Version 14 (`reports/<slug>.tap`) files via `workspace-service.cjs`.
 - **Exposed via `shell.cjs` (`browser.extract_tier_quotas`, `browser.evaluate_workload_quotas`, `browser.inspect_oauth_sso_redirect`, `browser.export_junit_tap_report`) and verified in Subtests 48 and 49 (`59/59` total suites passing).**
+
+### Phase 29: Hardware & Throughput Benchmark Extractor, WebSocket / SSE Live Stream Frame Observer, and CSL-JSON & RIS Bibliography Exporter
+- **`desktop/windows/browser/hardware-and-benchmark-spec-extractor.cjs`**:
+  - `extractHardwareAndPerformanceBenchmarks(snapshot)` and `compareBenchmarkThroughputAcrossOptions`: extracts throughput metrics (`120k req/sec` -> `120000` RPS, `45000 RPS`), tail latency percentiles (`p95 < 12 мс`), and hardware footprints (`16 vCPU`, `64 ГБ ОЗУ`) with exact UTF-16 `[startUtf16..endUtf16]` offsets and distinct `pageDate`/`eventDate`/`fetchedAt`, while rejecting bare benchmark links (`BARE_BENCHMARK_CLAIM_REJECTED`).
+- **`desktop/windows/browser/websocket-and-sse-live-stream-observer.cjs`**:
+  - `KosworkLiveStreamFrameObserver`: ingests bounded batches of Server-Sent Events (`text/event-stream`) and WebSocket frames into a versioned document snapshot (`pageVersion + 1`), computing exact UTF-16 `[startUtf16..endUtf16]` offsets for each stream frame and updating `eventDate` from frame payload dates while respecting `maxFramesPerBatch`, `maxStreamBytes`, and `AbortSignal`.
+- **`desktop/windows/browser/csl-json-and-ris-bibliography-exporter.cjs`**:
+  - `buildCslJsonAndRisBibliography(report)` and `saveCslJsonAndRisBibliographyViaWorkspace`: exports verified research sources and their UTF-16 quotes into standard CSL-JSON (`reports/<slug>-csl.json`, Zotero/Pandoc `citeproc`) and RIS (`reports/<slug>.ris`, `TY  - ELEC`) bibliography files via `workspace-service.cjs`.
+- **Exposed via `shell.cjs` (`browser.extract_hardware_benchmarks`, `browser.compare_benchmark_throughput`, `browser.observe_live_stream_batch`, `browser.export_csl_ris_bibliography`) and verified in Subtests 50 and 51 (`61/61` total suites passing).**
